  <para style="h">Gelindo Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Gelindo Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Gelindo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Gel</para>
  <para style="mt">Gelindo Kunlade Huaisan Ji 2 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Hudai isighala Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de shitu danlasan <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> gaijiughala <char style="png">Gelindo</char>ni Hudai jiohui, pse <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>ni shentulade man xin huaizho. <verse eid="2CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Mai ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sidaghazhi Kieliechen Hudade Mafan Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani ada Hudade doula. Hheshi ubali xiichen ada wo, shiheni sidaghazhi kieliechen Huda wo. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Hhe olon kunnan dunda matai sidaghazhi kieliezhi hhe ogisan sidaghaku kieliesanghala matan psedu kunnan shouisan kunlai sidaghazhi kielie shidane. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Matan Mexihai kui olon shouisan mutun Mexihai tungo giezhi sidaghaku kielienye olon wo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Bijien kunnan shouise tai sidaghazhi jiuikude oluzho. Bijienyi sidaghazhi kieliese tai sidaghazhi kieliekude oluzho. Ene sidaghazhi kielieku bijien shouisan xianlitu kunnanni ta shouikude tai rennai gieghane. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Ta bijien mutun ku shouise sidaghaku kielienyiye jienliekui bijien mejiene, ingiese bijien tande xiwon giesan goujida ulie bienjine.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Gaijiula, bijien <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de shouisan kunnanni tande ulie mejieghaku duran uwo. Hhe shihoude bijien danjisan achanshi bijien danji dakui wo, lien amituraku xiwon da widazho. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Bijien sumulase bijienyi ijin sixin panjiwo giezho. Ingiekushi bijienyi goyadene ese kouighazhi fugusan kunyi aminne olughasan Hudade kouighane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10-11"/>Huda bijienyi fuguku wixiense jiuiwo, da izhi jiuine. Taye onxian giezhi bijiende banman giema, hhe pse bijienyi jiuikui bijien hende xiwon giezho. Ingiezhi olon kunla bijiende onxian giedene Huda dain giese olon kunla bijienyi yenyin jiere Hudade mafan kieliene.<verse eid="2CO 1:10-11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Jihuane Bienjighawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Bijien duyade giekude, tebieshi tanre laiwon giekude Huda ogisan zhijieji shixinji zhugheghala giezho. Kunni jienzhaghala ese giezhi Hudai nenjienghala giezho. Enende bijienyi lianxin ganzhen beine. Ingiezhi giesande bijien goyane kuaine. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Bijien ede tande huaisanshi zhao ta onshizhi dunjireku mutun huaizho. Ta ede bijienyi man dunjire dazhoma, bi xiwon giese man dunjire. <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>Ingiese Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i udude bijien tai kuaiku mutun taye bijienyi kuaine.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Made intu xinxin bise sumulazhi xien tai hhende echizhi tande ghuareifa nenjien ireghaye giezho. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Jiushi tai hhense jingo giezhi <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de echine, ingie <char style="png">Maqidun</char>se khareizhi tai dunda iredene ta mii <char style="png">Yudaya</char>de khughose giezho. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Bi ingiezhi jihua giese suibiende giezhou? Bi duyai banfaghala jihua giezhi enbene giekude pusho giezhi kielienu? <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Bi kekaotu Hudai zhiizhi kielieye. Bijien tande kieliese yu enbene yu pusho giezhi ulie kieliene. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Bi, <char style="pn">Seila</char>, <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> ghuralie tai dunda chonjisan Hudai kewon, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihashi enbene giekude pusho giekui pusho. Hhende zinie enbekui wine. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Hudai dain giesanla giedughanliuzhe Mexihai sudoro man enbekui wo. Ingiese matan Mexihai tungo giezhi amine kieliezhi Hudai kuaine. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Mexihai miende bijienyi tanre hhantu khiduzheghazhi teshu wiliede oluzhi matanyi sunghusanshi Huda wo. <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Hhe matai jiere zhanzi taizhi Shenlinni mai zhughede ogizhi yajin daruwo.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Bi <char style="png">Gelindo</char>de pse ese irekushi tande oluzho. Enende Huda made ganzhen bei giezhi bi kielie shidane. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Bijien tai xinyanni gonjine gieku pusho, tai bayasughane giezhi tanre hhantu wilie giezho. Ta xinyan jierene beizhi undanlazho.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Bi tai hhende echise pse nangoni deilazhi ulie echine giezhi jiejin giewo. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Bi tai nango gieghazhoshi bi nango gieghasan tanse chugo kien mii bayasughane? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Bi eqighandei xinni huaikushi bi irekude indan mii bayasughaku kunla khareidene mii nango gieghakuse ayizho. Bi bayasuse ta dajialaye bayasukui bi xianxin giezho. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Bi eqighandei zhughedemi otuzhi yuchou giezhi wilazhi tande xin huaikushi tai nango gieghane ese giezho, bi tande matugie oresei mejieghane giezho.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zui Fanjisan Kunni Mienlie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Kunni nango gieghasan hhe kun zinie mii nango gieghakui pusho, ta dajialaiye man ezighan nango gieghazho. Bi ingiezhi kieliese hende gofen uwo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Intu kunyi ta olon kunla qingie faise kuruwo, <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>ede khareidene hhei rouliezhi sughazhi kielie, pse nango olon giese bazilie dane. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Ingiese bi tai xiahua gieye, ta hhe kunde oreku zhughene goude mejiegha. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Bi eqighandei xinni huaikushi ta yan shiqindeliuzhe shunjinu ulie shunjikui shiizhi mejiene giezho. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Ta kienyi mienliese bi kienyi mienliene. Bi kienyi mienliese Mexihai melie tande oluzhi mienliezho, <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>pse Ibilisi matanyi pienyi zhanjine. Matan hhei mujii ulie mejiekui pusho.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Teloyade Munan Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Bi Mexihani gouxioxide oluzhi <char style="png">Teloya</char>de echise Ezhan made gouxioxi chonjiku wijienni niewoma, <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>bi oresan gaijiu <char style="pn">Qido</char>i chanla dase zhughedemi nanran uwo. Ingie hhendedu kunlade salan gie <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de echiwo.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihai Tungo Giezhi Injine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Hudade mafan kielieye, hhe Mexihare hhantu matanyi chan uduruzhi zhan eghizhi injighazho. Pse matai tungo giezhi Mexihai taniku andatui gochude funqieghazho. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Bugon jiuisan kun, widachen kun dunda matanshi Hudade ogiku Mexihani andatu widao wo. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Ene widao widachen kunlade fugughaku fumughei wo, jiuisan kunlade aminni andatui wo. Kien intu renwuni gie shidane? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Bijien olon kunla mutun Hudai daolii baer huiku dunxi ese danlaghazho. Bijien jianjise Huda peisan mutun Hudai melie Mexihai kouizhi shixinji giezho.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Shini Yenjisan Kieliende Gonjia Danlaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Bijien pse goyane jieshao gie qiiwu? Bijien niezhan kunla wo giezhi bijienyi jieshao xinni tande oginu? Tanse jieshao xin keredene kunlade oginu? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Tashijiu bijienyi jieshao xin wo, bijienyi zhughede huaizhi kunla man tanizhi onshizho. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Ta minminjishi Mexihani xin wo, bijienyi tungo giezhi huaisan wo. Meshuighala huaisan pusho, chanqiku Hudai Ruhherghala huaisan wo. Tashi jiere ese huaizho, kunni zhughe jiere huaizho.<verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Bijien Mexihani tungo giezhi Hudai melie qingiezhi xianxin giezho. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Ingiezhi kieliese bijien goya nengandene kouizho giesan pusho. Bijienni nenganshi Hudase iresan wo. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Huda bijiende shini yenjisan kieliende gonjia danlaku nengou ogizho. Ene yenjisan kielienshi uroughala giesan pusho, ruhherghala giesan wo. Urou kunni fugughane, ruhher kunde amin ogine.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Tashi jiere uroughala huaisan fuguku wilie irekude fama bizhi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla <char style="pn">Musa</char>i khizha jieredu widaku gonni uzhe dazhoma, <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>Shenlinni wiliei famani genjia fugie uwonu? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Kunde zui jinjiku wiliede fama bise kunni gounide sanaku wiliede fama genjia fugie wo. <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Ene tebieji fugie famani yenyinghala eqighanku fama widawo. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Hhe zhanshi jiere bidene widakude fama bise hhe chanqikude fama genjia olon wo.<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Ingiese matande intu xiwon bise fugie danzighala kieliene. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Matan <char style="pn">Musa</char> wo giezhi shoujinghala khizhane huighazhi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai hhe niechaku famani widakui ulie chanlaghane gie ese giezho. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Ingieliuzhe hhelai zhughe khiduzhezhi eli kutula khuichen yenjisan kielienni onshikude ene shoujinni da ese agizho. Ene shoujinni Mexihare hhantulase agi widaghane. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Eli kutula niefanie <char style="pn">Musa</char>i shuni onshikude shoujin hhelai zhughede wo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Hhelani zhughe giezhe Ezhande shunjise shoujin giezhe widane. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Ezhanshi hhe ruhher wo, Ezhanni ruhher khalashi khala ziyu wine. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Matan man shoujin ese khaghasan khizhaghala Ezhanni famani uzhezhi, Ezhanyi yanzi mutun bienjizhi yebeiseye fugie famatu gholuzho. Ene Ezhanyi ruhherse irezho.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Wagangan Sudorodu Boubei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Ingiese Huda bijiende ubali xiizhi ene renwui ogise bijien zhughe ulie widane. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Khareidene niuighazhi giesan shizheku shiqinyi bendawo. Piendaku shiqin ulie giezhi Hudai daolii ulie wirulaghane. Zhendaoni qinchude kieliezhi Hudai melie jien lianxintu kunlade goyane jieshao giene. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Bijien chonjisan gouxioxii khaghazhoshi widachen kunlade khaghazho. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Ene duyai Ibilisi enezighan xianxin ulie giechen kunlai nudunyi sugho gholughazhi gouxioxii gonni ese chanlaghazho. Ene gouxioxide Mexihai famani kieliezho. Mexihashi Hudai yanzi wo. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Bijien chonjisanshi goyane pusho. <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihashi Ezhan bikui, pse <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi tande hoji danlasanni chonjizho. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>"Kharanise gon khizhe" giezhi kieliesan Huda <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai khizha jieredu goya famane mejieghaku gonni mai zhughede zhouighazho.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Bijiende ene boubei winema, bijienshi zinie boubei teiku wagangan wo. Ingiekushi tebieji fugie nenlishi bijiennughun pusho Hudanughun bikui mejieghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Bijienyi simiense daruzhoma, daruzhi yama giegha dazho. Zhughede kunnan winema, xiwon ese widazho. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Heizhoma, Huda bijienyi ese bendazho. Eghi unaghazhoma, eghizhi ala dazho. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Bijien beye jierene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni duya ijiekui chan deilakushi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni aminni bijienyi jiereye xienjizhi khizheghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Bijien amitukude <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni yenyinghala chan fuguku wixien dunda wo. Ingiekushi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni aminyi bijienyi fuguku beye jiere xienjizhi khizheghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Ingie uzhese fuguku bijienyi jiere ochirazho, amin tai jiere ochirazho.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Jinwun jiere, "Bi xianxin giezho, ingiese bi kieliezho." giezhi huaisan mutun bijiendeye xianxianji xianxin gieku wine, ingiese bijien xianxin giedene kieliezho. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i aminne olughasan hhe bijienyiye <char style="pn">Ersa</char>re hhantu aminne olughazhi bijienyi tanre hhantu hhei melie beighakui bijien mejiene. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Enelashi man tande oluzhi giezho. Ingiese nenjien yebeiseye olon kunlade echizhi mafan gieku zhughe olodozhi kuaikui Hudade ogine.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Giekui Kouizhi Udu Dao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Ingiese bijien zhughe ulie widane. Bijienyi beye goujijia qida olunema, zhughe niudunie shinishizho. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Bijienyi zhanshi jieredu gongien kunnan jianlai ireku hashu witu chanqiku fugie famani chenjighane. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Bijien gonxin giekushi chanlaku pusho, chanla daku wo. Chanlakushi niechaku wo, chanla dakushi chanqiku wo.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Mai zemin jieredu zhanfanyi chei widaghase Hudai hhense ireku gie matande winekui matan mejiene. Kunni khaghala giesan pusho, asiman jieredu chanqiku gie wo. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Matan ene zhanfande shonholozhi asimanse iresan gieghala jien musiku mutun arunzhakui panjizho. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Qingie musise hulan muchughun ulie gholune. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Matan ene zhanfande gunduni beiliezhi shonholokushi teine ese giezho, musine giezho. Ingiezhi ene fuguku beyei amin yenji boughane. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Ene mujide oluzhi matai nanpeilasanshi Huda wo. Hhe matande Shenlinni yajin danlaghazhi ogiwo.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Ingiese, matan beyede bikude Ezhanse gholo bikui mejienema, matande chan fugie danzi wine. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Matan yan giese chanlakughala ese giezho, xianxin giekughala giezho. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Matande fugie danzi wine. Beyese likai giezhi Ezhanghala hhantu souku genjia duran wine. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Ingiese matan beyedeye olune beyese likai gieye olune matanyi mujishi hhei bayasughane. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Matan man bixi Mexihani shenpantai melie xienjizhi khizheghadene zhao jien kun giesan gouni, doghunni mutun kharulune.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunlai Hudaghala Goudaghaku Renwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Ezhanshi indan zunjikui bijien mejiese kunlade sughazhi kieliene. Huda bijienyi mejiene, bi xiwon giese taye zhughedene bijienyi mejie. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Bijien pse tande goyalane jieshao ese giezho, bijienyi kuaiku jihuini tande ogine giezho. Ingiese hhezighan zhughei ulie uzhedene mienzii uzhezhi kuaisan kunlai melie kieliekui wine. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Bijien fenjiulise Hudade oluzho, zhenchanshi tande oluzho. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Ingiekushi Mexihani oreku bijienyi biizho. Nie kun soyuji kunlade oluzhi duya ijiese soyuji kunla duya ijiesanyi bijien mejiene. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Mexiha soyuji kunlade oluzhi duya ijiekushi amitu kunla pse goyadene oluzhi ulie amiturazhi hhelade oluzhi duya ijiedene aminne olusan Ezhande oluzhi amituraghane giezho.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Ingiese enedu khuinase matan kienniliuzhe kunni uzhedanghala ulie uzhene. Eqighandei Mexihaniye kunni uzhedanghala uzhewoma, ede pse qingiezhi ulie uzhene. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Kien Mexihai miende bise hheshi shini giesan kun wo, khuichennila daozhi man shinii gholuwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Enelashi man Hudase iresan wo. Hhe <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi matanyi goyarene goudaghazhi pse kun Hudaghala goudaghaku renwuni matande ogiwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Eneshijiu Huda duyai kunlai zuini ese asadene Mexihai tungo giezhi goyarene goudaghazho. Pse goudaghaku daolini matande jiuizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Ingiese matan Mexihai daibio giezho. Huda matai tungo giezhi kunlade sidaghazhi kieliezho. Matan Mexihai oronde ta Hudare gouda giezhi tai xiahua gieye. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Huda hhe zui wituni matande oluzhi zuitu gholughakushi matanyi hhei sudoro Hudai gouni gholughane giezho.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Hudare hhantu wilie giesan bijien tai xiahua gieye, Hudai nenjienni jienliezhi belienni bu gholugha. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Huda kieliezhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">"Heshitu shihoude bi chinughunyi chenliewo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Jiuiku udude bi chade banman giewo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">giezho. Uzhe, ede zhen heshitu shihou wo, uzhe, ede zhen jiuiku udu wo!<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Bijien giesan wiliene ulie sugieghane giezhi jinlianji kiendeliuzhe chijia ese teizho. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Khareidene goyaneshi Hudai hoji wo giezhi yanyanji shiqin jiere uzheghazho. Jiushi olon rennai gieku, kunnan, chijia shiqin, zeinan, <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>eghiku, khaku, nouiku, khishulaku, kijie daku, ijie daku dunda <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>bijien ganjinde giezhi erlin, rennai gieku, renyi, Shenlin, zhenzhenji oreku, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>shuhua kielieku, Hudai nenlighala giezho. Borun soghei khade gundan uqi bareidene <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>bugon bijienyi zunjiye hao, shizheghaye hao, sugieye hao, kuaiye hao bijien ingiezhi giezho. Kunla kieliese piendachen wo giezhoma, bijien shuhua kieliezho. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Bijienyi kiema ulie mejiene giezhoma, niere fugie no wo. Fuguwo giezhoma, amitu wo. Bijienyi faizhoma, ese alazho. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Bijien yuchou giesanyi xianlima, chan bayasuzho. Nanxin wo giezhoma, olon kunlai bayazheghazho. Uzhese yama uwoma, yanliuzhe wine.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>
    <char style="png">Gelindo</char> kunlaya, bijien tande zhijie kieliezhi zhughene keighazho. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Bijien tai zhughei ese meilashighazho, ta goyalane meilashighazho. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Bi kewosidene kielieku mutun kielieye, bijien giesan mutun taye bijiende zhughene keigha.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chanqiku Mechi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Ta xianxin ulie giechen kunlare nie jiabanyi bu zho. Gouni mouxiennighala matugie hhantulane? Gon kharanighala matugie laiwon giene? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Bilie</char>ghala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6:15</char> <char style="em">Ibilisi</char> </note> matugie heqishine? Xianxin giesan, ulie xianxin giesanghala matugie hhantu giene? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Mechi nigiedaghala matugie hhantulane? Matanshi chanqiku mechi wo. Zhen Huda kieliesan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">"Bi hhelai dunda souzhi hhelare laiwon giene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Bi hhelade Huda danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Hhela made bexin danlane."<verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Ezhan kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">"Ingiese ta hhelai dundase khizhezhi hhelase danxinra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Zannan dunxilai bu shighama, bi tai jienliene.<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Bi tande ada danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Ta made kewon oqin danlane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Eneshi nenlitu Ezhan kieliesan wo."<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Ingiese mii orentula, matande enezighan dain giesan bise beye, zhughe jieredu zannannilane waghazhi man widaghadene Hudai zunjiku zhugheghala onqienji zhiguishighaye.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiohuini Kunla Geise Baolo Bayasuzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Ta aghui zhugheghala bijienyi jienlie. Bijien kiemai ese kuighazho, kiemai ese heizhi pienyi ese zhanjizho. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliekushi tai kheilane ese giezho. Bi eqighandei kieliezhi daosan mutun ta chan bijienyi zhughede bizhi bijien tanre amiturazhi fuguliuzhe hhantulaku duran wine. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Bi tande xinxin fugie wo, tai ologhonni kuaizhi zhughedemi futan no wo. Bijien shouisan olon kunnan dunda bi hende bayasuzho.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Bijien <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de kurudeneye hhamura dazhi gochuse kunnan shouizho. Ghadane maodun wo, sudoro ayizho. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Ingieliuzhe xiwon widasan kunlai sidaghazhi kieliesan Huda <char style="pn">Qido</char>i irekui tungo giezhi bijienyi sidaghazhi kieliewo. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Zinie hhei irekughala pusho, hhe tai hhense jienliesan sidaghazhi kieliekughala bijienyi sidaghazhi kieliewo. Ta mii sanasan, goya nango giesan, pse ta made rexinde giesei hhe made man kieliese bi genjia bayasuzho. <verse eid="2CO 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Bi tande hhe xinni huaizhi tai zhanshi jiere nango gieghasei mejiedene houhui giezhoma pse houhui ulie giene. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Ede bi bayasukushi tai nango gieghasande pusho, nango giedene geiikude echighasande wo. Ta Hudai isi mutun nango giedene bijien tai ese shanjizho. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Zhao Hudai isi mutun nango giese houhui ulie giezhi geidene jiuine. Duyai nango gieku kunyi fugughane. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Ta nie uzhe, ta zhao Hudai isi mutun nango giedene ede tai dunda imegheni rexinde gieku, goyane huiku, doghunnide hokuku, jinshen khizheku, mini sanaku, bayasuzhi gieku, codasanni faiku wine. Ene shiqin jiere go fanmiende ta goyalane gou bikui zhenmin giezho. <verse eid="2CO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Ingiese bi tande hhe xinni huaise pienyi zhanjisan kunde ese huaizho, kuighasan kundeye ese huaizho. Khareidene ta bijiende rexin bisei Hudai melie tande zhenmin giene giezho. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Ingiese bijienyi sidaghazhi kieliewo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Ene sidaghasanse chugo ta olon kunla <char style="pn">Qido</char>ni zhughei futanshighazhi bayasughase bijien genjia bayasuzho. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Bi <char style="pn">Qido</char>de tai kuaizhi daozhoma, ta mii ese shizheghazho. Bijien tande kieliesan kielienshi man zhenni bikui mutun bijien <char style="pn">Qido</char>de tai kuaisanshi zhenni bikui zhenmin giewo. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Ta manla hhei shunjizhi ayi pugharazhi goude jienliesei hhe sumula irese tande oreku zhughe genjia hhereizho. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Bi tande onqienji zhughene teise bayasuzho.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Bayasuzhi Ogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Gaijiula, Huda <char style="png">Maqidun</char> jiohuilade ogisan nenjienni bi tande mejieghaye. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Kunnan dunda hhelai fugiede shiikude hende bayasuzhi tebieji nanxin bikude kunlade tebieji dafande ogizho. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Hhela banman giekude zhao nenlighalane, pse nenlisene chaogo giezhi goyalane ogisei bi ganzhen bei shidane. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Hhela bijienyi haojihui hende xiahua giezhi shentulade banman gieku shiqin jiere jihui ogizhi guzi beigha giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Hhela giesan bijien sumulasanse olon chaogo giezho. Hhela goyane xien Ezhande ogizhi pse Hudai isighala bijiende ogizho. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Ingiese bijien <char style="pn">Qido</char>de ene gou shiqinyi chi kaishi giese tai dunda giezhi chengun olugha giezhi sughazhi kieliewo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Ta xianxin gieku, kielien kielieku, erlin, rexin, bijien tande oreku jiere man kunlase zui goude giesan mutun nanxin kunlade banman gieku shiqin jiereye zui goude giekui bijien xiwon giezho.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliese tande ese fenfulazho, kunlai rexinghala tai oreku zhugheshi shixinji enbenu pusho bikui uzhene giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjienyi ta mejiene. Hhe yenlai bayan wo, tande oluzhi nanxinshikushi hhei nanxinnighala tai bayazheghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Kunlade ogiku shiqin jiere bi tande sumulakune kielieye. Ta ingiezhi giese gou wo. Ta udai honse ene shiqinyi zui melie giezho, zui melie duralazhoma, <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>giezhi qiikude bisan rexin mutun ede ene shiqinyi giezhi chengun olugha. Zhao nengou biku mutun gie. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Ta duranghalane ogise Huda jienliene. Uwokulane ogi ese giezho, winekulane ogi giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Bi kunlai gongienshighazhi tande kunnan ireghane ese giezho, manlai izhishighane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Edeku tai bayan hhelai chaisande banman gie shidaku mutun hhelai bayan jianlai tai chaisande banman giene, ingiese izhishiwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Olon ghurasanlade feiliekui uwo, choghon ghurasanlade chaikui uwo."<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qido Lienshoularene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Bi tande oluzhi rexintu zhughei <char style="pn">Qido</char>i zhughede teisan Hudade mafan kielieye. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/><char style="pn">Qido</char> bijien fenfulasei chenliezhoma, goyane genjia rexin bizhi yenyizhe tai hhende echiwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Bijien da nie gaijiui peizhi hhere hhantu echighawo. Ene kunyi gouxioxi chonjiku jiere olon jiohuila man kuaizho. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Zinie ene pusho, jiohuila hhei sunghudene peizhi bijienre hhantu echighazhi bijiende jiuizhi ogisan baerni khughoghazho. Bijien ene gou shiqinyi giese Ezhanni famade oluzho, bijien gou zhughene mejieghazho. <verse eid="2CO 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Bijien ingiezhi giekushi ene olon baerni gonjikude kunlai ulie sugieghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Bijien gou shiqin giese zinie Ezhanni melie gieku pusho, kunlai melieye ingiezho. <verse eid="2CO 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Bijien pse nie gaijiui peizhi hhelare hhantu echighawo. Bijien olon shiqin jiere hhei kaoyen olon giedene hhende rexin bikui mejiewo. Ede hhe tai hende xianxin giedene genjia rexinshizho. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/><char style="pn">Qido</char>i kieliese hheshi mii nokie wo, tande oluzhi mare lienshou gholuzho. Pse hhe ghua gaijiushi jiohuila peisan wo, Mexihani fama wo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Ingiese ta jiohuilai melie oreku zhughene, pse bijien tai kuaisei hhelade zhenmin gie.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Nanxintu Shentulade Ogiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Shentulade banman gieku shiqinyi kieliese bi tande xin huaiku biyo uwo. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Tande gou zhughe bikui bi mejiene. Bi <char style="png">Maqidun</char> kunlade <char style="png">Yagaiya</char> kunla udai honse zhunbei giezho giezhi tai kuaizho. Tai rexin olon kunlai zhughei gojiolughazho. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Ede bi hhe giedun gaijiulai peizhi echighakushi zhao mii kielienzhe tai zhunbei gie goudaghane giezho. Pse bijien ene shiqin jiere tai kuaisan belienni gholune. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Babuchu <char style="png">Maqidun</char> kunla mare hhantu echizhi ta ese zhunbei giesei chanlase ta shizhekui pse bu kielieye, bijien tai xianxin giesan shizhekui gholune. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Ingiese bi sumulase hhe giedun gaijiui xien peizhi tai hhende echighazhi ta dain giesan olon mureni zhunbei gie goudagha giezhi goude kielieku biyo wine. Ingiezhi giese ta khireighasanshi biisan pusho, duranzhe giesan wo.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Eneshijiu choghon tareisan choghon ghurane, olon tareisan olon ghurane giesan wo. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Jien kun zhughedene jiejin giesan mutun ogikuni wo. Chijia bu tei, ye bu bii. Duranzhe khireighasan kunlade Huda xiqi wo. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Huda yanyanji nenjienlai tande olon ogizhi yandeliuzhe chan kurughazhi yanyanji gou shiqinni tai olon gieghane. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Hhe dafande nanxin kunlade ogizho, hhei gundan chanqi wine." <verse eid="2CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Tareisan kunde fure ogisan, kunde ijiuni ogisan Huda tareiku fureni tande ogizhi olodoghane, ta giesan gundan wiliede jiego olon khizheghane. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Tai gofanmiende bayazheghazhi suishisui dafande kunlade ogighane. Ingiezhi bijien giesan wiliei tungo giezhi Hudade mafan kielieghane. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Ene banman gieku shiqinyi giezhi zinie shentulade chaisei buisan pusho, olon kunlai Hudade mafan kielieku tebie olodoghazho. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Ta Mexihai gouxioxii chenren giezhi shunjizhi hhelade, pse olon kunlade dafande ogiku wiliei hhela kaoyen giedene Hudai kuaizho. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Huda tande tebieji fugie nenjien ogizho. Ingiese hhela tande oluzhi onxian giezhi tai sanazho. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Nenjienyini kieliezhi baragha daku Hudade mafan kielieye!<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Goyane Huizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> qinsi Mexihani renyi, gou zhugheghala tande goude kielieye. Kunla kieliese bi tai chujieghekude goyane meilade uzhezho, tai hhende uwokude wizha wo giezho. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Bi xiahua gieye, bijien duyani banfaghala giezho giezhi sumulasanlade bi wizhade gienema, bi tai hhende echikude mii biizhi wizhade bu giegha. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Bijien duyade udu daozhoma, duyani banfaghala zhan ese eghinduzho. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Bijien eghinduku uqishi duyanughun pusho, Hudai nenlitu wo, khidun chenqianni unaghane. <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Bijien kun zhenjindusan, pse kunni danlazhi Hudai ulie tanighazhi goyane fugiede uzhesan yanyanjilai man widaghane. Yanyanji sumuladanlai man barei iredene Mexihade shunjighane. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Ta onqienji shunjikude soyuji ese shunjisan kunlai faikui bijien zhunbei gie goudaghazho.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Ta shiqin uzhese zinie mienzii uzhene. Niezhan kun goyaneshi Mexihanughun wo giese hhe goude sumulakui wo, hheshi Mexihanughun mutun bijienshiye Mexihanughun wo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Ezhan bijiende qienli ogikushi tai qida olugha ese giezho, hendagha giezho. Bijienyi qienlii bi goujinie gofende kuaise shizhene ulie giene. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliekushi bi xin huaizhi tai ayighane giezhi tai ulie sumulaghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Niezhan kun kieliese hhei xin yenge wo, khidun wo, kunni chujieghese zholien wo. Hhe jianjisan yama jiazhi uwo giezho. <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Intu kunla indan mejiekui wo. Bijien tai hhende uwokude xin jiere matugie kieliezhoshi chujieghese matugie giene.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Bijien hhezighan goyane jieshao giesan kunghala ulie bilane. Hhela goyane goya nanjizho, goyane goya bilazho, hhela men no wo. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Bijienyi kieliese bijien kuaise kamasene ulie daone. Zhao Huda bijiende nanjizhi ogisan kamaghala giene. Ene kama tai hhendeye kuruzho. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Bijien tai hhende echise kamasene daoku pusho. Shijishan bijien Mexihani gouxioxii lien tai hhendeye echizhi chonjizho. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Bijien kamasene ese daozhi kunlai khishulasanghala ese kuaizho. Bijien xiwon giese tai xianxin gieku fugiedakude tai dundadu bijienyi kamaye daghazhi hende fugiedase giezho. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Ingiese kunlai oronde kunla giesan wiliede ulie kuaizhi gouxioxini tanse chugo psedu oronlade chonjine giezho. <verse eid="2CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>"Kien kuaise Ezhanyi kuai!" <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Kaoyen giedene olusan kunshi goyane jieshao giesan pusho, Ezhan jieshao giesan wo.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Jia Shitulare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Bi goujinie ben kun danlayema, ta rennai gie. Bi xiwon giese ta rennai gie. <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Hudai dubilieku zhugheghala bi tande hende orezho. Bi tai nie zhanguijide boluwo. Ganjin oqin wo giezhi Mexihade ogiwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Moghei jienzhaghala <char style="pn">Hhawa</char>i piendasan mutun ta Mexihade olusan zhenzhenji oreku zhughe widakuse bi ayizho. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Niezhan kunla irezhi bijien ese chonjisan da nie <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tande chonjise, pse ta jienliezhi ese daosan buxiantu ruhherni jienliezhi ta jieshou giezhi ese daosan buxiantu gouxioxii jieshou gieghase ta jienliezho! <verse eid="2CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Bi sumulase bi hhezighan famatu shitu wo giesanlase goujida bixin uwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Mii koucai hen uwoma, unhua boghoni uwo. Enei bijien gofanmiende olon banfaghala tande zhenmin giewo.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Bi tai undudaghane giezhi goyane boghonidaghazhi Hudai gouxioxii tande belien chonjise zui fanjizhou? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Bi psedu jiohuilase gunzi bareidene tande lilian khighase qianlakughala niekielien wo. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Bi tai hhende bikude made chaikude kiemade chijia ese teizho. <char style="png">Maqidun</char>se iresan gaijiula made chaisei ogizhi kughazho. Bi gofanmiende goyane tande achan ese gholuzho, jianlaiye ulie gholune. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/><char style="png">Yagaiya</char> oronde bi ingiezhi kuaikui kiemada danla dane. Mii sudoro bisan Mexihai zhendaoi zhiizhi bi ingiezhi kielie shidane. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Yangiezhi? Bi tande ulie orenu? Bi orekui Huda mejiene.<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Bi ede giesanne izhi giene. Ingiekushi goya kuaisan bijienre niekielien wo giesan hhezighan jihui ereisan kunlade jihuini siraghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Hhe izhun kunlashi jia shitu wo, piendachen wiliechi wo, Mexihani shitu wo giezhi jiazhon giezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Ene hunerei uwo. Ibilisiye gieghantu qienxienni jiazhon giezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Ingiese Ibilisini hojilaye gundanni hoji jiazhon gieseye ghudure uwo. Hhelai jiego hhela giesan mutun gholune.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Shouku Giesanne Kieliezhi Huizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Bi pse kielieye, kiemada mii ben kun mutun bu uzhe. Ben kun mutun uzheliuzhe bi goyane goujinie kuaikui ta jienlie. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliese Ezhanni qienlighala ese giezho, nie ben kun wo giezhi fugiede tunguliezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Olon kunla duyani biozhunghala kuaise biye kuaiye. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Ta zhenzhenji jienzha wo, bayasuzhi ben kunlai jienliezho! <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Kien tai hoji danlaghazhi qianlazhi pienyi zhanjizhi meilade uzhezhi khizha jieretai eghise ta rennai giezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Bi ingiezhi kieliese shizhenema, bijien zholienshi qingiezhi gie dane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ingieliuzhe kun yan shiqin jiere kuai shidase biye kuai shidane. Enei bi ben kun mutun kieliezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Hhelashi <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kun onu? Biye enbene. <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun onu? Biye enbene. <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdei onu? Biye enbene. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Mexihani hoji onu? Bi ingie kieliese fenjiulizhoma, biye genjia enbene. Bi hhelase olon khishulazhi bafanzi olon souzhi olon mabienzi neizhi haojihui aminde wixien khizhezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Bi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlase 39 gie mabienzi eghikui 5 hui neizho. <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Mii banbanghala 3 hui eghizho, 1 hui tashidazho, hai jiere 3 hui zeinan penjizhi chon qida oluzho, 1 hui hai jiere niudu nie xii hheliezho. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Olonfa mo yokude moronni wixien, qiandaoni wixien, goya kunlai wixien, niman kunlai wixien, chenshii wixien, hontanni wixien, haini wixien, jia gaijiulani wixienyi penjizho. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Khishulazhi shouku giezho, olonfa hhuntura dazho, oliesuzhi undasuzho, olonfa ijiuni chaizho, gonjiezho, musiku jien uwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Psedulase chugo go jiohuilade zhughe chilazhi niudunie mii jiere achan daruzho. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Kien zholierese bi ulie zholierenu? Kien zui fanjise bi ulie jindanu?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Ijinyo kuaine giese bi zholiennine kuaine. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni ada Huda bi ghudan ese kieliesei mejiene. Hhei chanqi doulakui wo. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Bi <char style="png">Damashige</char>de bikude <char style="pn">Yalida</char> honshanni kha douradu fugie noyen <char style="png">Damashige</char> chenshini sagheighazhi mii bareine giezhoma, <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>kunla mii nie lanlande teidene chenqian jieredu chongunse jiuzhilie bouzheghase hhei khase andawo.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Zholiennine Kuaizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Kuaise yama haochu uwoma, bi ijinyo kuaine. Ede bi Ezhan made zhoujin mutun uzheghazhi mejieghasei kielieye. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Bi Mexihai miende nie kunyi tanine. Hhei 14 nien qien ji 3 cen asiman jiere qila khireiwo. Beyere hhantu khireiwu beyese likai gie khireisei bi ulie mejiene, zinie Huda mejiene. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Bi intu kunyi tanine. Beyere hhantu khireiwu beyese likai gie khireisei bi ulie mejiene, zinie Huda mejiene. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Hhei qientande qila khireise kielie daku kielienyi sonosuwo. Enei kun kieliese ulie olukui wo. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Ene kunde oluzhi bi kuainema, goyadene oluzhi zholiennisene chugo yama ulie kuaine. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Bi kieliesanshi zhenni wo, ingiese bi kuaine gieliuzhe guazi pusho. Ingieliuzhe bi goyane ulie kuaine, pse kunla mase uzhezhi chenliesansene gofende mii uzhene. <verse eid="2CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Made uzheghasan tebie famashi bi goyane kondakuse ayizhi mii beye jiere nie eghesun teizho. Eneshi Ibilisi peisan wo, mii zayalazhi ese kondaghazho. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Ene shiqinde oluzhi bi Ezhande ene eghesunyi mii jierese widagha giezhi 3 hui xiahua giese <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>hhe made kieliewo, "Mii nenjien chade kuruzho. Mii nenli kunni zholienni jiere onqienshine." Ingiese bi goya zholiennine kuaikude hende xiqi bizhi Mexihani nenlii goya jierene huighane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Bi Mexihani yenyinde oluzhi zholien, shizheghaku, kunnan, heiku, chijia bikude bayasuzho. Bi yan shihoude zholienshi yan shihoude khidun wo.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Shitu Bikui Zhenmin Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Bi ene nie guazi kunshi ta biisan wo. Shijishan ta indan mii jieshao giekuni wo. Bi yama pushoma, hhezighan famatu shitu wo giesanlase goujida bixin uwo. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Bi tai dunda hende rennai giezhi ghudureqi, fugie shiqin, nenlitu shiqinni giezhi bishi shitu bikui zhenmin giewo. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Zinie bi tande achan ese danlasan ene shiqinse chugo bi tande psedu jiohuilase bixinde giezhou? Mii ene codasanyi ta rouliesha.<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Ede bi zhunbei giezhi ji 3 hui tai hhende echine giezho. Tande yama achan ulie danlane, bi keresanshi tai dunxi pusho, tai zhughe wo. Kewosila ada anadene oluzhi baer cunjikui pusho, ada ana kesiladene oluzhi baer cunjikui wo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Bi tande oluzhi bayasuzhi bisanlane ogizhi lien goyane man ogiku duran wine. Bi tande ye olon orese ta made ye choghon orenu? <verse eid="2CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Bi tande achan ese danlasei man mejiekui woma, niezhan kunla kieliese bishi nie jienzha kun wo, piendakughala tai bareizho giezho. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Bi tai hhende peizhi echighasan alinie kunyi tungo giezhi tai pienyi zhanjiwo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Bi <char style="pn">Qido</char>i tai hhende echighazhi hhere hhantu hhe nie gaijiui echighawo. <char style="pn">Qido</char> tai pienyi zhanjiwu? Bijien wilie giese nie zhugheghala ese giezhi nie korolonghala ese yozhou?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Ta sumulase bijien izhi tai melie goyane huizho giezhou? Bijien Mexihai miende Hudai melie kieliezho. Mii orentula, bijien giesanlashi man tai hendaghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Bi echikude bi xiwon giesande ta ese daizhi ta xiwon giesande bi ese daisei mejiekuse ayizho. Zhenjinduku, dubilieku, piqi shuaiku, goyadene oluku, sugieku, xienhua kielieku, goyane undude uzheku, londaku shiqin winekuse ayizho. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Bi pse echikude bi zunjisan Huda tai melie mii shizheghakuse ayizho. Eqighandei olon kunla zui fanjizhi zannanni giezhi lon kijiezhi hu giedene ulie geisande bi nango giekuse ayizho.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Jingao Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Eneshi bi ji 3 hui tai hhende echine giezho. Ingiese "jien zhasan shiqinlai ghua, ghuran kunni ganzhenghala shidaghane". <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Bi ji 2 hui tai hhende irekude hhezighan melieshida zui fanjisan kunji psedu soyuji kunlade jingao giezhi daosan mutun ede bi tai hhende uwokude pse jingao gieye, bi pse irese jiedui ulie rouliene. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Ingiekushi Mexiha mii tungo giezhi kieliesan zhenjini ta ereizho. Mexiha tande zholiende ulie giene, khidunde giene. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Hhei zholiennii yenyinzhe shizijia jiere ghada fugughawoma, Hudai nenlighala amitu wo. Bijien hhere hhantu zholien woma, tai hhende echikude Hudai nenlighala hhere hhantu amiturane.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Ta xinyan dunda udu daozhoye giezhi goyane jiencha gie. Goyane nie kaoyen gie. <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tai sudoro bikui ta ulie mejienu? Enei mejie dase ta kaoyen giezhi dao dazho. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Bi xiwon giese bijien kaoyen giezhi daokui ta mejiene. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Bijien Hudase onxian giezhi tai yama codasei ulie gieghane. Bijien kaoyen giezhi daokui uzheghaku pusho. Kunla uzhese bijien shibai gieliuzhe tai gounii gieghane giezho. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Bijien yan shiqindeliuzhe zhendaoni duizhi gie dane, hhende oluzhi giene. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Bijien zholien bizhi ta khidun bikude bijien bayasuzho. Ta onqientu gholu giezhi bijien ingiezhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Ingiese bi tai hhende wikude ene kielienyi tande huaikushi bi tai chanlakudei zhao Ezhan made ogisan qienlighala tande gundude ulie giene giezho. Ene qienli kunni bixindaghaku pusho, hendaghaku wo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Gaijiula, zuihoude kielieye, ta bayasundu. Onqientu kun gholuzhi bijien surughasei chenlie. Maodun bu khizhezhi heqishi. Ingiese oreku winetu, pinnantu Huda chan tanre hhantu wo. <verse eid="2CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Ta zhughesene nieniedene kielien asa. Shentula man tande kielien asazho.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien, Hudai oreku, Shenlinni laiwon gieku chan tanre hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
